# GoldHEN Plugins Configuration
# Copy this to /data/GoldHEN/plugins.ini on your PS4
#
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT load this plugin under [default]!
# Loading it under [default] will cause the PS4 to crash when launching homebrew applications.
# Always specify the game Title ID (e.g., CUSAXXXXX) where you want to use the controller:

[CUSA00123]
/data/GoldHEN/plugins/xbox_controller.prx

# [CUSA00456]
# /data/GoldHEN/plugins/xbox_controller.prx
